                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>A subranox can have up to three Medium creatures swallowed. In addition, the subranox's respiratory system passes some of the atmosphere the subranox breathes into the creature's storage compartment. Creatures swallowed by the subranox are not at risk of suffocating if they can breathe the atmosphere outside the subranox.</p>"
