            },
            "privateNotes": "",
            "publicNotes": "<p>Subranoxes are large, lumbering components designed to capture and subdue creatures that the Krethiskar Swarm wants taken alive. Their wide, toothless maws open on two axes, allowing them to easily grip and swallow prey whole. Once swallowed by a subranox, a creature is held in a large hollow that makes up the main part of their wide, barrel-shaped abdomen. There, glands secrete a paralytic bile meant to incapacitate without killing, while the subranox's respiratory system supplies the cavity with air to prevent suffocation.</p><hr /><p>The Krethiskar Swarm has developed new types of Swarm components to further its goals in the Szandite Collective systems.</p>",
            "publication": {
                "license": "ORC",
                "remaster": true,
                "title": "Starfinder Secrets of the Swarm Adventure Path"
            }
